---
---`POST /rdb/v1/regions/{region}/instances/{instance_id}/renew-certificate`
---@param input scaleway.rdb_v1.RenewInstanceCertificateRequest
---@return scaleway.rdb_v1.RenewInstanceCertificateResponse? value
---@return distilled.Error? err
function Client:renew_instance_certificate(input) end

---Resync a Read Replica
---
---When you resync a Read Replica, first it is reset, then its data is resynchronized from the primary node. Your Read Replica remains unavailable during the resync process. The duration of this process is proportional to the size of your Database Instance.
---The configured endpoints do not change.
---
---`POST /rdb/v1/regions/{region}/read-replicas/{read_replica_id}/reset`
---@param input scaleway.rdb_v1.ResetReadReplicaRequest
---@return scaleway.rdb_v1.ReadReplica? value
---@return distilled.Error? err
function Client:reset_read_replica(input) end

